@startuml 015-notification-seq-lifecycle
title Notification Engine - Async Dispatch via Outbox & WebSocket

participant "Domain Service\n(e.g., BookingService)" as DomainSvc
participant "NotificationService" as NotifSvc
participant "NotificationOutboxPublisher" as OutboxPub
database "Database" as DB
participant "Outbox Worker\n(Scheduled Task)" as Worker
participant "NotificationDispatchHandler" as Handler
participant "NotificationWebSocketPublisher" as WSPub
actor "Client (Browser/App)" as Client

== 1. Domain Event & Transaction ==
note over DomainSvc, DB: Inside @Transactional
activate DomainSvc
DomainSvc -> DB: INSERT/UPDATE Domain Entity (e.g. Booking)

DomainSvc -> NotifSvc: sendNotification(userId, Type, title, ...)
activate NotifSvc
NotifSvc -> OutboxPub: enqueueDispatch(userId, Type, ...)
activate OutboxPub
OutboxPub -> OutboxPub: buildDedupeKey(...)
OutboxPub -> DB: INSERT outbox_events (type=NOTIFICATION_DISPATCH, payload=...)
OutboxPub --> NotifSvc: OutboxEvent
deactivate OutboxPub
NotifSvc --> DomainSvc: null
deactivate NotifSvc

DomainSvc -> DB: COMMIT Transaction
deactivate DomainSvc

== 2. Async Dispatch & Push ==
note over Worker, WSPub: Background Thread
Worker -> DB: SELECT * FROM outbox_events WHERE status=PENDING
activate Worker
Worker -> Handler: handle(event, payload)
activate Handler

Handler -> DB: check existsByDedupeKey(dedupeKey)
alt exists
    Handler -> Handler: Skip (Idempotent)
else not exists
    Handler -> DB: INSERT notifications (userId, type, title, dedupeKey, isRead=false)
    Handler -> WSPub: publishToUser(userId, Notification)
    activate WSPub
    WSPub -> Client: STOMP push over WebSocket\n/topic/users/{userId}/notifications
    WSPub --> Handler: done
    deactivate WSPub
end

Handler --> Worker: success
deactivate Handler
Worker -> DB: UPDATE outbox_events SET status=PROCESSED
deactivate Worker

== 3. Mark as Read (User Action) ==
Client -> NotifSvc: PATCH /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read
activate NotifSvc
NotifSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM notifications WHERE id = ?
NotifSvc -> DB: assert ownership
NotifSvc -> DB: UPDATE notifications SET is_read = true
NotifSvc --> Client: 200 OK
deactivate NotifSvc
@enduml
